cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoTRA in your research, please cite this software using the metadata from this file."
title: "CoTRA: Comprehensive Toolbox for RNA Sequencing Data Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Seemab"
    given-names: "Umair"
    email: "u.seemab@gmail.com"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-07
commit: "ee49510"
repository-code: "https://github.com/UmairSeemab/CoTRA"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/UmairSeemab/CoTRA/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
url: "https://github.com/UmairSeemab/CoTRA"
license: "GPL-3.0-only"
abstract: >-
  CoTRA is an R/Shiny framework for bulk RNA-seq and single-cell RNA-seq
  analysis. It provides workflows for data upload, quality control,
  differential expression, functional enrichment, dimensionality reduction,
  clustering, annotation, trajectory analysis, pathway activity analysis,
  differential abundance, cell-cell communication, and report generation.
keywords:
  - "RNA-seq"
  - "single-cell RNA-seq"
  - "bulk RNA-seq"
  - "transcriptomics"
  - "bioinformatics"
  - "R"
  - "Shiny"
